==English==
{{was wotd|2019|March|14}}

===Etymology===
[[File:Einstein 1933.jpg|thumb|{{w|Albert Einstein}} in 1933]]

From {{der|en|de|Einstein}}, the surname of {{w|Albert Einstein}} (1879–1955) + [[w:English language|English]] {{m|en|-ian|pos={{glossary|suffix}} forming {{glossary|adjective}}s or {{glossary|noun}}s meaning ‘belonging to, relating to, or like’}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/aɪnˈstaɪ.nɪ.ən/|a=RP,GA}}
* {{audio|en|en-au-Einsteinian.ogg|a=AU}}
* {{hyphenation|en|Ein|stein|i|an}}

